WEBVTT

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.860
Human Army transport craft
splashdown in sixty seconds!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.420
Observations from Grace reveal
air current speed is rising.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.090
Worm is still increasing in mass!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.310
Welle Shields 3 and 4, ready to deploy!

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.000
Can you do it?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:23.740
Yes, sir.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:04.970
Maintenance is complete.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.810
Believe in the mech, and in your own strength.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:08.940
Right!

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.110
Hiroto, where's your helmet?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.570
I gave it to my junior.

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:17.560
I see.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.160
Okay, closing up.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.740
I'm off!

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.340
Please... Protect everyone.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.340
Initiate cockpit-block intubation.

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.350
My first battle in two years...

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:07.390
Logarithm spiral formed.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.500
Core synchronization verified.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:11.000
Anti-Festum armor, all green!

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.880
All mechs ready to deploy at any time.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.320
Start up Siegfried System.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.980
Crossing complete.

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.760
All Fafners, stand by.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:24.510
Worm mass has stabilized.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.830
Individual density: 33.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.250
Atomic weight: 28

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.520
Festum materializing!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.700
It disappeared.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.160
Mizoguchi-san!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:52.170
Are you here?

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:02.890
I'm here.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.640
Right here.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.260
Grace is damaged.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.080
Arrows is guiding the enemy.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:50.260
Solomon has identified it as sphinx-type.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.730
Human Army transport craft about to splashdown.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.850
Close shields! Lock the enemy in!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:25.040
Welle Shields 3 and 4 deployed.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.290
Battlefield formation complete!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:28.930
Fafner unit, advance.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:30.930
Neidhöhle Gate open.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:33.930
Hatch grid: 32.06 degrees.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.960
Over here, Festum!

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.470
Gobain is on the scene!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.440
Fafner cross-dock, engage.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:29.200
Arrows, return to Takerujima.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.700
Arrows to CDC. Tracking, hand-over.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.630
Arrows, understood. We will guide Cetus.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.490
CDC, permission to attack with Mark Sieben?

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.460
Commander Makabe!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:42.900
Permission granted.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:44.960
Take Sieben to Takeru Island.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.470
Take this!

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.070
Mark Neun, forward.

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:56.350
Zwölf, scepter ready.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.810
Minashiro-kun...

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.500
Prepare for crossing.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.620
CDC granted permission?

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:05.400
This is the last regular pilot of our generation.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.670
Boarding in two minutes.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.410
If you're going to use one, use me.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:11.680
You're rear support. Got it?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.570
Roger.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.830
You don't have to try to make up for Kazuki.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.980
Yeah, I know.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.080
Thanks.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.650
You don't know at all.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:29.980
Okay... Fünf, forward.

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.140
Crossing?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:35.930
Mark Nicht?

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.120
And even Mark Sein.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.570
The mech that was sealed away...

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.090
How long is it going to haunt us?

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:46.760
Crossing denied.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:48.940
I won't let it interfere with us.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:53.030
That's the reason I'm here now.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:03.370
It disappeared?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.640
His first shared pain in four and a half years...

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:18.890
Rina!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.690
It's penetrated inside... Pain block won't work.

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:30.300
Forced destruction. Left arm necrosis.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:42.810
Bringing the enemy into the open!

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:44.630
Requesting saturation attack.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:47.040
Pull back to line 08! Hurry!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.300
Incoming!

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:14.420
Optics, heat, radio waves,
electrons, sound wave probe.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:15.900
No response.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.970
No... The worm's atmospheric
pressure has changed.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:19.990
This is it.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.120
Mark Sieben, target!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.070
Roger.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.750
Zwölf! Scepter, go!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:41.220
What?

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.610
This thing can do a lot...

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.430
According to Solomon's analysis,
the enemy has one core.

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.230
The rest are shadows!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.900
Shadows? But they're attacking!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.750
Looks bad.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.240
Damn it! Protect each other!

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.240
This is Cetus.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.770
We're sending in our forces.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:09.580
We will repel this threat together.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.940
Three Human Army Fafners
are heading to Hikojima!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.390
Release shields.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.720
Let them inside the field.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.220
They want to fight together?

00:10:22.090 --> 00:10:24.720
First machine, in flight.
Second machine will aid the torch-type.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.360
I'll go after the one that's
flinging around the sword.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:28.730
Roger.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.730
I finally get to fight.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:37.740
They're fast.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.530
They hit it at that speed?

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.090
What incredible skill.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.150
Hey, mind if we join in?

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:14.400
Why did these guys have to show up?

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.030
What? They're helping us?

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.380
That mech just attacked with its head?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:21.260
Akira!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.650
I guess you and we still can't
understand each other...

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:49.090
Enemy elimination confirmed!

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:52.940
Responding to Solomon...

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:53.970
What is this?

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.010
Hey!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.010
Jinnai! Over here!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.110
Pops!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.900
I'm comi—

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:12.060
What?

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.150
Is that a Festum?

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.150
How is it so huge?

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.250
It followed us?

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.170
Solomon is silent.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:43.680
It's disappeared.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.530
Looks like it got someone very
important onto the island.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.300
Release field.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.560
Let's greet our visitor.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.040
What are you doing? Head back.

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:02.850
But I can't trust him!

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.260
Don't forget...

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:07.490
The longer you pilot a Fafner, the harder
the assimilation phenomenon hits.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.920
Go back and get checked out.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.820
Fine.

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.990
Mark Zwölf, heading back!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.330
Here... You okay, Akira?

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.140
Thanks. You saved my skin.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.400
When they get back, we'll have
a talk about this!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.790
They need to be examined first.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.680
It's tough just watching over them, huh?

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:34.140
Yeah.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:45.500
So we've arrived on D Island.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.280
The Mir here is in the air.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:54.280
It's accepting us.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.040
The air...

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.300
Our state-of-the-art machine was trashed.

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:04.090
Hell, we're lucky to be alive.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:04.790
Captain!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:07.860
Oh, Masaoka... Thanks for
holding down the fort.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.220
What do you think this unit is?!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.140
Huh?

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.180
And you dragged Maya-chan into it!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.950
Stop leaving everything in Jinnai-san's
control, and do your job!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:24.290
Right... I'm sorry, Chief of Staff Masaoka!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:33.610
Narain Wiseman, of the Human
Army General Headquarters.

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:35.160
I thank you for your welcome.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:38.830
Makabe Fumihiko, Commander of
Alvis, Tatsumiyajima.

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:42.520
Is the Human Army led by officers now?

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:45.290
There are at least a hundred generals alone.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:47.990
Rank has no meaning anymore.

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:51.680
Those who have not lost their lives and
hope shoulder the responsibility.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:53.030
I agree.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:57.680
I'll need to have your Fafner pilots monitored
to ensure they are unarmed.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.560
Of course.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.810
It will be these three and myself.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:03.810
You can pilot a Fafner?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:08.970
Being the oldest pilot in history
is my own little claim to fame.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:13.820
Please grant us permission to
network with your pilots.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.570
You're Makabe?

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:16.660
What?

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.370
No, he's not Kazuki Makabe.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.080
Kazuki?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.490
Yes, the super ace pilot.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:26.200
He's the one who gave us
our own Makabe factor.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:29.090
The pilot who discovered
the North Pole Mir, right?

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:31.650
He is our hero...

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.300
Kazuki Makabe, of D Island.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:40.310
Kazuki...

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.290
Canon, welcome back.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:44.810
Why are you here?

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.650
I just wanted to see it...

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.790
Are you thinking of piloting it?

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:52.080
Nah.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:56.230
You've fought enough! You've done your part!

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:59.740
No one's piloting the Mark Sein?

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:02.430
It's too different. No one can.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:05.000
Once we succeed in extracting the core,

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.050
we plan to sink it to the bottom of the sea.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:08.430
I see.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:12.420
Don't!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:15.430
It tries to take the life of
anyone who steps inside!

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:20.180
Don't get any closer... Please!

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.380
Canon...

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:24.380
If you won't listen to me, I'll stop you by force!

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:34.010
Your hand's really warm.

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.670
Sorry for intruding, Canon.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.740
Nothing beats a Ramune after battle!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.640
I wish I could quit being a pilot.

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:10.900
But when I think that my juniors are next
in line, I feel like I have to stay on.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.540
Yeah.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:18.270
For our sakes, Kenji-senpai stayed
as a Fafner pilot so long, too.

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.390
The pain killer is habit-forming.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:28.250
If you still have pain, Toumi-sensei said to
undergo pulse treatment with Akira.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.040
Got it.

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.540
Hey, is Miwa-chan at Alvis?

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.600
Will we have to let the Human Army meet her?

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.180
Th-That's what I heard.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:40.090
Toumi, put some clothes on!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.290
What's wrong with you two? Aren't you doctors?

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.610
You've got a lot to learn.

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:48.990
You know, you...

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.800
That's not the problem.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.110
Is it time yet?

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.610
Huh, Mama? Mama...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:58.490
Soon, okay? Just wait like a good girl.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:02.000
I've been waiting for a long, long time!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.340
Emery!

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.090
I finally get to see you!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.720
I believed you were real.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:29.350
I knew you weren't just my imagination.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.570
Yeah, I'm right here.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.060
These two were in communication,
even while separated?

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:42.490
It's a miracle brought about by Mir's mediation.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:44.240
Mir?

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:46.440
The core of the Festums' consciousness,

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:50.140
and an omnipotent structure that can
metamorphose into anything.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.620
I believe you know that part very well.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:56.130
That girl can communicate with Mir, as well?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:59.570
It seems her younger brother chanced
upon a fragment of it.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:03.060
It was most likely a part of the
North Pole Mir that survived.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:07.640
Emery learned from her brother how to
communicate using that fragment.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.650
Where is her brother now?

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:14.170
At one time, her town became a battlefield.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:20.450
Her brother pleaded through the Mir
fragment for the slaughter to cease.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.900
He spoke with the Festum?

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.530
Yes. And the enemy left.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:30.210
In exchange, her brother and their family
were assimilated into the Mir.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:35.120
It's unclear why only she remains.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:42.810
But we call those who can communicate
with Mir like she can the "Esperanto."

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.430
"Hope"...

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:48.700
Yes, it's the name of a language
created by humanity,

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.200
a language constructed so that

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:52.970
two groups could understand
each other and stop fighting.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.440
It is true hope.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.530
I thought you'd already be open.

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.690
Toumi...

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.140
Nothing in the shopping district is open yet.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:14.000
You should rest.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:17.060
I'm fine. After they're examined,
the others will be here.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:21.460
Where's Mizoguchi-san? We've got
a delivery to make.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:24.450
He's in a meeting. I'll take it.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.510
No, I'll—

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.470
Excuse us.

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:30.400
Is Kazuki-kun... There you are.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.350
Jinnai-san, what's up?

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:36.020
I brought visitors.
On Commander Makabe's orders.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.030
My dad?

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:44.180
Aishwarya Fein, Fafner pilot, Perseus Company.

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:46.740
Please call me Ai, Kazuki Makabe.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:48.490
How do you know my name?

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.450
Billy Morgan. I'm a pilot.

00:21:55.470 --> 00:22:00.460
Captain of the Perseus Company Fafner
Unit, Jonathan Mitsuhiro Bartland.

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:01.960
Mitsuhiro?

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.470
I'm honored to meet the legendary hero.

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:12.100
It's thanks to you that I can fight.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:13.430
Huh? Me?

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:14.600
Amazing...

00:22:14.950 --> 00:22:17.850
I'm actually in the presence of the Makabe factor!

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:19.060
Factor?

00:22:20.450 --> 00:22:21.780
You will learn...

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:27.240
That the meeting of two hopes will
not necessarily lead to peace.

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.480
As long as "to protect" means "to fight,"

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:35.260
hope can be found in battle.

00:22:37.010 --> 00:22:39.650
We embraced the possibility of losing everything,

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:43.140
as we searched for a future.

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:48.760
To choose any other path was unacceptable.

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:25.440
<i>Fafner in the Azure: Exodus</i>, episode 3:

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:26.980
The Price of a Conversation.
